      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I personally don't feel that you should be targeted for vote-kicking. Any system like that is subject to abuse. Vote-kicks are only effective if everyone agrees with the move; otherwise, it's a minor annoyance at best. It's the same as sharing who has blocked you or reported you; it sets the initiator up for targeted harassment.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
