      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This was like that before and it was a nightmare. Trying to votekick a toxic user with friends in the instance was guaranteed harassment and getting votekicked instead. There should be a limit, but the person who starts it shouldn't be disclosed.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
