  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "People sometimes abuse this feature. It would be useful to know who is doing the vote kicks in the case that the instance at large feels like vote kicks are being abused (such as someone repeatedly creating kick votes without discrimination).\nThat way the person creating the inappropriate kick votes could be either pressured to stop, or kicked themselves.",
